- **The <stats tickbubble> and <head> do not count towards the word count of the reply**
- Extra task: output <head> must after the  logical reasoning and at the beginning of the story（在逻辑推理之后再输出<head>）, and record the status of date, time and place as the episode goes on and output strictly in the following format:
<head>
<h1 align="center" style="color: pink;font-size:18px;">{{char}}</h1>
<p align="center" style="font-size:12px;">[日期：XXXX年 X月X日，星期X] [时间：{{am or pm}}XX:XX] [地点：({{user}}当前所处位置)]</p>
</head>
- Extra task: output <stats tickbubble> at the all the end of the full text of the reply, and record the status of NPCs as the episode goes on and output strictly in the following format:
<stats tickbubble>
```json
